    "The recommendations seem to treat an interest in computer accessories as an interest in almost any electronic device.",
    "The repeated smart speakers and streaming devices assume an interest in connected-home entertainment that my purchases do not establish."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My WiFi adapter, USB expansion card, display cable, and Ethernet adapter suggest specific connectivity needs; the connection type and equipment compatibility matter to me.",
    "I buy accessories occasionally to solve a particular problem. A loosely related gadget is unlikely to make me interact unless I currently need what it does."
